# IDE - VSCode
# Ignore local VSCode state, but keep the settings shared with the team.
# (Do not ignore `.vscode` itself: git will not descend into an ignored
# directory, so the negations below would never apply.)
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json